2
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:48,500
よみがえれ
Revive...

3
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:59,000
空と大地が 交差している
The sky and the earth are crossing paths,

4
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:03,000
今たたずんでる この世界で
in this world where I stand right now.

5
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:06,800
命が生まれ また沈んでく
Life is born and then fades away,

6
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:10,000
繰り返される 営みの中
within the endless flow of life.

7
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:13,600
こんなもんと よぎった瞬間
When I thought, "This is just how it is,"

8
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:16,800
夢は力をなくす
dreams lose their power.

9
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,500
もう一度 生まれよう
Let's be born once more,

10
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:24,000
この場所で
right here in this place.

11
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:29,200
正義のその奥で 夢が息づいている
Deep within justice, dreams are breathing alive.

12
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:32,800
重なる力を信じて
Believing in the power that we share,

13
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:36,500
正義のその奥に 闇が潜んでいる
deep within justice, darkness is lurking.

14
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:40,000
見極めろ 全てを
See it all clearly!

15
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,800
振り上げた勇気は 切り裂くためじゃない
The courage we raised isn't meant to tear apart,

16
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,500
引き合う絆で
but with the bonds drawing us together,

17
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:54,500
呼び覚ませ 鮮やかに
vividly awakening!

18
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:05,000
傷ついて 行き場をなくし
Wounded and losing our place to go,

19
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:08,500
さまよっている その魂を
that wandering soul...

20
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:12,000
癒す力は 心の奥で
The power to heal is deep within the heart,

21
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:16,000
静かに鼓動を刻んでいる
quietly beating away.

22
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:22,500
持てる力 全てぶつけ 涙を流すのなら
If you're going to put all your strength into it and shed tears,

23
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:29,500
選ぶべき道は 君を待っている
the path you should choose is waiting for you.

24
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:34,800
見失った今と 通り過ぎた過去
Between the lost present and the passing past,

25
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:38,200
狭間で諦めるよりも
rather than giving up in despair,

26
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:41,500
今目をそらさずに ここから始めよう
let's start fresh from here without looking away.

27
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:45,000
見極めろ 明日を
See tomorrow clearly!

28
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:49,000
誰かに見せ付ける 勇気は脱ぎ捨てて
Cast off the courage meant to show off to others,

29
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:52,500
素顔に戻ろう
and return to your true self.

30
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:59,500
呼び覚ませ 鮮やかに
Vividly awakening!

31
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,200
正義のその奥で 夢が息づいている
Deep within justice, dreams are breathing alive.

32
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:38,500
重なる力を信じて
Believing in the power that we share,

33
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:42,200
正義のその奥に 闇が潜んでいる
deep within justice, darkness is lurking.

34
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:45,800
見極めろ 全てを
See it all clearly!

35
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:49,200
振り上げた勇気は 切り裂くためじゃない
The courage we raised isn't meant to tear apart,

36
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:52,200
引き合う絆で
but with the bonds drawing us together,

37
00:04:52,800 --> 00:05:00,000
呼び覚ませ 鮮やかに
vividly awakening!

38
00:05:42,676 --> 00:05:45,176
はーい！みなさん、こんかた！
Hi everyone, Konkata!

39
00:05:45,336 --> 00:05:49,216
かなたそと神曲アニソンFes!!へようこそいらっしゃいました！
Welcome to Kanataso's God-tier Anison Fes!!

40
00:05:49,336 --> 00:05:53,376
イェーイ、ありがとー！ありがとー！
Yay, thank you! Thank you!

41
00:05:54,356 --> 00:06:00,616
はい、ということでハッシュタグは#天音かなた誕祭2024でいっぱい呟いてください！
So please tweet a lot using the hashtag #AmaneKanataBirthday2024!

42
00:06:01,016 --> 00:06:06,156
ワンモアで！がんばるで！みんなもがんばってね！いっぱい呟いてね！
One more time! Do your best! Everyone do your best too! Tweet a lot!

43
00:06:06,856 --> 00:06:09,696
ということで本日お客さん入ってます！どうぞー！
So today we have an audience here! Tada!

44
00:06:10,756 --> 00:06:15,596
うぱおだー！みなさん知ってますか、うぱおという存在を。
It's Upao! Do you all know the existence of Upao?

45
00:06:16,156 --> 00:06:21,156
え、みんなじゃなきゃね、ちょっと認知度が低く、あんまりグッズも売れてないんですけども
Well, if it's not you guys, its recognition is a bit low, and not much merchandise sells, but...

46
00:06:21,156 --> 00:06:25,576
そんなこと言ったらみんなに愛されるキャラになりました！よかったね、うぱお。
after saying things like that, it became a character loved by everyone! Good for you, Upao.

47
00:06:25,876 --> 00:06:31,916
うぱお役もやりつつ、本日頑張っていこうと思います。たくさんのうぱおに囲まれて歌っていきます！
While playing the role of Upao, I'll do my best today. I'll sing surrounded by lots of Upaos!

48
00:06:32,076 --> 00:06:36,576
それでは早速次の曲まいりましょう！いくぞー！
Now then, let's move on to the next song! Here we go!

49
00:06:50,094 --> 00:06:53,314
みんなもっともっと盛り上がれますかー！
Can everyone get even more hyped up?!

50
00:06:54,094 --> 00:06:58,214
さっそく、もうゲストがが登場します！
Now, our guest is appearing!

51
00:06:58,474 --> 00:07:00,694
トップバッターはフレアです、どうぞー！
Our top batter is Flare, go ahead!

52
00:07:01,129 --> 00:07:02,949
放て！心に刻んだ夢を
Fire away! The dreams in your heart

53
00:07:02,949 --> 00:07:05,189
未来さえ置き去りにして
Leaving even the future behind

54
00:07:05,189 --> 00:07:07,479
限界なんて知らない 意味ない！
It knows no limits and has no meaning!

55
00:07:07,679 --> 00:07:11,459
この能力が光散らす その先に遥かな想いを
My power radiates these distant feelings ahead

56
00:07:22,030 --> 00:07:25,810
歩いてきたこの道を 振り返ることしか
If I can only look back on this path I've walked

57
00:07:25,810 --> 00:07:28,930
出来ないなら…今ここで全てを壊せる
I could destroy it all here and now...

58
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:39,130
暗闇に落ちる街並み 人はどこまで立ち向かえるの？
Streets in darkness, how far can people resist?

59
00:07:42,250 --> 00:07:48,310
加速するその痛みから 誰かをきっと守れるよ
I'm sure I can protect someone from this accelerating pain

60
00:07:50,051 --> 00:07:52,291
Looking! The blitz loop this planet to search way.

61
00:07:52,551 --> 00:07:54,611
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. 今すぐ
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it right now

62
00:07:56,251 --> 00:08:00,031
身体中を 光の速さで 駆け巡った 確かな予感
A certain premonition running through my body at light speed

63
00:08:04,151 --> 00:08:07,251
掴め！望むものなら残さず 輝ける自分らしさで
Catch it! Don't leave your wishes behind with your shining self

64
00:08:09,931 --> 00:08:13,231
信じてるよ あの日の誓いを
I believe in the vow we made that day

65
00:08:13,791 --> 00:08:19,471
この瞳に光る涙 それさえも強さに変わるから
Even the tears shining in these eyes will turn into strength

66
00:08:24,491 --> 00:08:30,411
立ち止まると 少しだけ 感じる切なさに 戸惑うことないなんて嘘をつかないよ
Stopping for a moment, feeling a slight sorrow—I won't lie and say I don't hesitate

67
00:08:37,812 --> 00:08:41,352
宙に舞うコインが描く 放物線が決める運命
The parabola drawn by the coin dancing in the air determines our fate

68
00:08:44,712 --> 00:08:50,572
打ち出した答えが今日も 私の胸を駆け巡る
The answer I fired out rushes through my chest again today

69
00:08:51,992 --> 00:08:54,392
Sparkling! The shiny lights awake true desire.

70
00:08:54,572 --> 00:08:56,572
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. 必ず
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it without fail

71
00:08:59,612 --> 00:09:04,992
貫いてく 迷うことなく 傷ついても 走り続ける
Piercing through without hesitation, keeping on running even if hurt

72
00:09:05,633 --> 00:09:12,193
狙え！凛と煌く視線は 狂い無く闇を切り裂く
Aim! The dignified and glittering gaze cuts through the darkness without fail

73
00:09:12,253 --> 00:09:14,633
迷いなんて吹き飛ばせばいい
Just blow away any hesitation

74
00:09:15,553 --> 00:09:19,213
この心が叫ぶ限り 誰ひとり邪魔などさせない
As long as this heart screams, I won't let anyone get in the way

75
00:09:52,554 --> 00:09:59,894
儚く舞う無数の願いは この両手に積もってゆく
Countless transient wishes dance and pile up in these hands

76
00:10:00,136 --> 00:10:02,166
切り裂く闇に見えてくるのは 重く深く切ない記憶
Cutting through the darkness comes heavy, deep, painful memories

77
00:10:02,166 --> 00:10:06,116
色褪せてく現実に揺れる 絶望には負けたくない
Trembling in a fading reality, I don't want to yield to despair

78
00:10:06,116 --> 00:10:09,116
私が今 私であることを 胸を張って 全て誇れる!
I will puff out my chest and be proud that I am myself right now!

79
00:10:09,116 --> 00:10:11,866
Looking! The blitz loop this planet to search way.

80
00:10:11,866 --> 00:10:15,566
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it.

81
00:10:15,566 --> 00:10:20,166
今すぐ 身体中を 光の速さで 駆け巡った 確かな 予感
A certain premonition that ran through my body at the speed of light right now

82
00:10:20,166 --> 00:10:24,366
掴め! 望むものなら残さず 輝ける自分らしさで
Catch it! If it's your wish, don't leave anything behind, with your shining individuality

83
00:10:24,366 --> 00:10:27,466
信じてるよ あの日の誓いを
I believe in the vow of that day

84
00:10:27,466 --> 00:10:31,266
この瞳に光る涙 それさえも強さになるから
Even the tears shining in these eyes will become strength

85
00:10:31,266 --> 00:10:35,266
立ち止まるとなんだか少しだけ感じる切なさに 戸惑う事ないなんて嘘はつけないよ
Standing still, I feel a slight pain; I can't lie and say I'm not confused at all

86
00:10:35,266 --> 00:10:39,466
穹舞うコインが描く 放物線が決める運命
The parabola drawn by the coin dancing in the sky decides our fate

87
00:10:39,466 --> 00:10:43,666
打ち出した答えが今日も 私の胸を駆け巡る
The answer I shot out rushes through my heart again today

88
00:10:43,666 --> 00:10:46,466
Sparkling! The shiny lights awake true desire.

89
00:10:46,466 --> 00:10:49,966
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it.

90
00:11:09,116 --> 00:11:12,766
素晴らしき世界に今日も乾杯
A toast today as well to this wonderful world

91
00:11:12,766 --> 00:11:15,266
街に飛び交う笑い声も
Even the laughter echoing through the town

92
00:11:15,266 --> 00:11:19,466
見て見ぬふりしてるだけの作りもんさ
Are just manufactured things turning a blind eye

93
00:11:19,466 --> 00:11:21,766
気付け触れそうだ
I feel like I'm losing my mind

94
00:11:21,766 --> 00:11:24,666
クラクラするほどの良い匂いが
A sweet scent so intoxicating

95
00:11:24,666 --> 00:11:27,016
ツンと刺した鼻の奥
Pierces sharply deep inside my nose

96
00:11:27,016 --> 00:11:30,866
目を覚ます本能のまま今日は誰の番だ
Following my awakening instincts, whose turn is it today?

97
00:11:31,866 --> 00:11:34,766
この世界で何ができるのか
What can I do in this world?

98
00:11:34,766 --> 00:11:37,766
僕には何ができるのか
What can I do?

99
00:11:37,766 --> 00:11:43,966
ただその真っ黒な目から 涙零れ落ちないように
Just so tears won't overflow from those pitch-black eyes of mine

100
00:11:43,966 --> 00:11:47,466
願う未来に何度でもずっと 喰らい付く
No matter how many times, I will bite down onto the future I wish for

101
00:11:47,466 --> 00:11:50,066
この間違いだらけの世界の中
In this world full of mistakes

102
00:11:50,066 --> 00:11:54,966
君には笑ってほしいから
Because I want you to smile

103
00:11:54,966 --> 00:12:00,266
もう誰も傷付けない 強く強くなりたいんだよ
I won't hurt anyone anymore, I want to grow stronger, stronger

104
00:12:00,266 --> 00:12:03,266
僕が僕でいられるように
So that I can remain myself

105
00:12:11,866 --> 00:12:15,566
素晴らしき世界は今日も安泰
Today as well, this wonderful world is safe

106
00:12:15,566 --> 00:12:18,066
街に渦巻く悪い話も
Bad rumors swirling around the town

107
00:12:18,066 --> 00:12:22,166
知らない知らないふりして目を逸らした
I acted like I didn't know, turning my gaze away

108
00:12:22,166 --> 00:12:26,966
正気の沙汰じゃないな 真面目に着飾った行進
It's sheer madness, a procession dressed up seriously

109
00:12:26,966 --> 00:12:29,266
鳴らす足音が弾む行き先は
The destination of the bouncing footsteps is ringing

110
00:12:29,266 --> 00:12:35,066
消えない消えない味が染み付いている 裏側の世界
The taste that never fades is stained within, the world on the other side

111
00:12:45,866 --> 00:12:50,166
清く正しく生きること 誰も悲しませずに生きること
To live purely and righteously, to live without making anyone sad

112
00:12:50,166 --> 00:12:56,066
はみ出さず真っ直ぐに生きること それが間違いしないで生きること
To live straight without stepping out of bounds, to live without any mistakes

113
00:12:56,066 --> 00:13:02,366
ありのまま生きることが正義か 騙し騙し生きるのは正解か
Is living just as you are justice? Is living deceitfully the correct answer?

114
00:13:02,366 --> 00:13:09,166
僕のあるべき姿と離れた 本当の僕は小魚なんだ 教えてくれよ
Diverging from the way I should be, the real me is just a small fry. Please tell me!

115
00:13:19,366 --> 00:13:24,066
今日も答えのない世界の中で 願ってるんだよ
Still wishing within this world with no answers today as well

116
00:13:24,066 --> 00:13:30,366
不器用だけれド いつまでも君とただ笑っていたいから
Even though I'm clumsy, because I just want to laugh with you forever

117
00:13:30,366 --> 00:13:39,066
跳ねる心臓が身体揺らし叫ぶんだよ 今こそ動き出せ!
My beating heart shakes my body and screams, now is the time to make a move!

118
00:13:39,966 --> 00:13:45,066
弱い自分を何度でもずっと 喰らい付く
No matter how many times, I will bite down onto my weak self

119
00:13:45,066 --> 00:13:50,066
この間違いだらけの世界の中 君には笑ってほしいから
In this world full of mistakes, because I want you to smile

120
00:13:50,066 --> 00:13:55,766
もう誰も傷付けない 強く強くなりたいんだよ
I won't hurt anyone anymore, I want to grow stronger, stronger

121
00:13:55,766 --> 00:14:00,366
僕が僕でいられるように
So that I can remain myself

122
00:14:10,066 --> 00:14:18,366
ただ君を守るそのために 走る走る走るんだよ 僕の中の僕を超える
Just to protect you, I'll run, run, run, surpassing the me inside of me!

123
00:14:52,216 --> 00:14:55,966
まるでお伽の話 終わり迎えた証
Many days tinted in fairy tale scenes, arrived at the end, proof we have seen

124
00:14:55,966 --> 00:14:59,966
長過ぎる旅路から切り出した一節
I cut out and choose from a trip so long a little passage

125
00:15:00,249 --> 00:15:01,809
まるで御伽の話
Like a fairy tale,

126
00:15:01,809 --> 00:15:03,059
終わり迎えた証
the proof it reached its end.

127
00:15:03,059 --> 00:15:05,929
長過ぎる旅路から切り出した一節
A fragment carved from a journey far too long.

128
00:15:05,929 --> 00:15:08,599
それはかつてこの地に影を落とした悪を
This was once the evil that cast its shadow upon this land,

129
00:15:08,599 --> 00:15:10,579
討ち取りし勇者との短い旅の記憶
memories of a short journey with the hero who defeated it.

130
00:15:21,044 --> 00:15:22,504
物語は終わり
The story is over,

131
00:15:22,504 --> 00:15:25,454
勇者は眠りにつく
and the hero goes to sleep.

132
00:15:25,454 --> 00:15:27,954
穏やかな日常を
A peaceful everyday life

133
00:15:27,954 --> 00:15:30,024
この地に残して
left behind in this land.

134
00:15:30,024 --> 00:15:32,024
時の流れは無情に
The flow of time, mercilessly,

135
00:15:32,024 --> 00:15:34,524
人を忘れさせる
makes people forget.

136
00:15:34,524 --> 00:15:37,874
そこに生きた軌跡も錆び付いていく
Even the traces of life lived there are rusting away.

137
00:15:37,874 --> 00:15:40,874
それでも君の
Even so, your words,

138
00:15:40,874 --> 00:15:43,924
言葉も願いも勇気も
your wishes, your courage,

139
00:15:43,924 --> 00:15:48,824
今も確かに私の中で生きている
still live on securely inside me.

140
00:15:49,474 --> 00:15:52,474
同じ道を選んだそれだけだったはずなのに
We chose the same path, or so it should have been, but—

141
00:15:52,474 --> 00:15:55,474
いつの間にかどうして
before I knew it, why

142
00:15:55,474 --> 00:15:58,774
頬を伝う涙の理由をもっと知りたいんだ
do tears stream down my cheeks? I want to know more.

